# Run tests before finishing

Before committing or declaring any coding task complete:

1. Run `composer lint` from the plugin root.
2. Run the changed or added tests: `vendor/bin/phpunit --filter <TestClassOrMethod>`.
3. If either command fails, fix the failures or stop and report — never commit failing code.
4. The full PHP version matrix is left to CI; do not run the entire suite locally unless the task requires it.

Skip only when the change cannot affect PHP/runtime behavior (e.g. docs-only or pure `.mdc` wording with no code/config impact).
